// gRPC was picked over HTTP:
//
//   - Review is bidirectional because a person working a queue wants their
//     decisions to take effect on work still running. Over HTTP that is polling
//     plus a submit endpoint, which is the same thing with latency and more
//     state on both sides.
//   - WatchJob is server-streaming because progress on a minutes-long job is a
//     stream, and SSE is a stream pretending to be a response.
//   - UploadSource is client-streaming because a corpus is not a field in a
